/* T4 셸: 최종 아트/스타일은 Manyfast V9 승인 전까지 회색 박스로 둔다 (docs/00_TATS_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md). */

.settings {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: rgb(24, 26, 30);
    padding: 5%;
}

.settings__title {
    font-size: 28px;
    color: rgb(232, 234, 237);
    margin-bottom: 4%;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
}

.settings__rows {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 60%;
    min-width: 360px;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 2%;
}

.settings__row {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.settings__row-label {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
    color: rgb(200, 204, 210);
}

.settings__row-value {
    min-height: 44px;
    min-width: 44px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 16px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    color: rgb(232, 234, 237);
    background-color: rgb(42, 45, 52);
    border-width: 2px;
    border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.settings__row-value:hover {
    background-color: rgb(54, 58, 66);
}

/* T8: 비활성 대비 4.5:1 이상(docs/23 T8) — rgb(120,124,130)은 이 배경에서 3.28:1로 미달이라
   rgb(152,156,160)(4.99:1)로 올렸다. */
.settings__row-value:disabled {
    color: rgb(152, 156, 160);
}

.settings__focusable--focused {
    border-color: rgb(122, 171, 255);
}

.settings__saved-label {
    width: 60%;
    min-width: 360px;
    max-width: 640px;
    color: rgb(122, 214, 149);
    font-size: 14px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    margin-bottom: 2%;
}

.settings__actions {
    flex-direction: row;
    width: 60%;
    min-width: 360px;
    max-width: 640px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 2%;
}

.settings__action {
    min-height: 44px;
    min-width: 44px;
    padding: 8px 24px;
    font-size: 18px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    color: rgb(232, 234, 237);
    background-color: rgb(42, 45, 52);
    border-width: 2px;
    border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.settings__action:hover {
    background-color: rgb(54, 58, 66);
}

.settings__action--primary {
    background-color: rgb(58, 84, 132);
}
